Number of integer partitions with no 1's whose parts can be combined together using additions and multiplications to obtain n.

The 20 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A319925

